{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人意外地爱上对方，在亲近与克制之间反复摇摆：起初怕自己的喜欢成为负担，后来又怕失去这份关系。随着对方一次次没有退开，他逐渐学会坦然表达喜欢、珍惜眼前，不再逼自己索要永远的保证。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却不敢靠近\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近甜蜜又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"沉浸当下，话未出口\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕破坏亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"被看穿后怕太黏\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"如常亲近让他安心\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"想成为对方的依靠\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"主动回应仍怕未来\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"害怕失去这份亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"选择珍惜眼前\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再隐藏喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"尽情付出表达喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想要永远的保证\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"不索要永远，坦然喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06、S09、S13：对方明明没有退开，他却仍然担心有一天不再被需要，安心和孤单、希望和恐惧不断交替，情绪变化有些反复。最抓人的是从 S01 到 S14 的变化，尤其 S05 到 S11、S14：从害怕被看穿、害怕自己的喜欢成为负担，到终于不再隐藏感情，也不再强求永远的保证。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f342128-b0fc-4ea8-b734-8b92487ab688", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194454014224Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:45:55.114437+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a64252fdf094a5a3f3a05f5b8dbcafed1368332d05a05e2c2beebff4cdf83b26", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194454014224Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8d42fcdb5244894da85235fe9445ee5cb7ee976f35b44405d8fc14238173f1b0"}}}
